# GitNexus index store. Machine-local; the repo ships no index.
# `.gitnexusrc` sets skipContextFiles + skipSkills so `analyze` cannot inject an
# AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md block claiming this repo is indexed -- false for anyone who
# clones it, and this collection's bar is that a public claim survives being pulled on.
.gitnexus/

# Pi remote relay config (#471). Machine-local: it names this checkout's relay
# agent and starts the relay on launch. Untracked, it dirties the tree that
# `release_gate.py --release` requires clean. `.pi/engineering-env.json` stays tracked.
.pi/remote-pi/

# Local usage-log path for scripts/refresh_dispatch_counts.py (#548). Machine-local.
.skill-usage-log.local
